# Reviewed evidence: explicit allowlist, one path per line, no wildcards.
#
# Raw run logs (*.jsonl) stay ignored by default and are preserved in the dated
# handoff backup instead. A log is added here only once it has been reviewed as the
# evidence a release gate rests on - so a new raw log can never be published by
# accident, and every tracked one was put here on purpose.
#
#   gate4-1000-tap/results.jsonl  The Gate 4 record FINISH-CRITERIA.md cites by name.
#                                 Reviewed 1 Oct 2026: matches the 28 Sep backup and its
#                                 SHA256SUMS entry; contains no redacted value.
!/analysis/gate4-1000-tap/results.jsonl
